        "valueString": "No deformity or swelling. Diffuse anterolateral tenderness. Globally reduced active and passive range of motion, especially external rotation and abduction; painful at end range. Internal rotation also reduced. No focal bony tenderness over the clavicle, acromioclavicular joint or humeral head."
